{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 40 - 100 hours of potential content to milk, Dissociative is a dark fantasy nightmare adventure game. Spanning a vast unpredictable mindscape in search of answering perplexing questions, gain abilities and power ups and transfer in between dark worlds, light worlds in this seemingly endless dreamscape that is bent on consuming your very soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras/8beaa2855c73382bc0953f8d07819ee7.avif?t=1769511874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras_big/8beaa2855c73382bc0953f8d07819ee7.avif?t=1769511874 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a merging and dissociating between mirroring dream worlds, desolate nightmares, illusory happy dreams, hidden horrors and joyful goodness in this massive interconnected adventure game.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras/a3e31b8c2274606a63ebaf9cc40fe72f.avif?t=1769511874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras_big/a3e31b8c2274606a63ebaf9cc40fe72f.avif?t=1769511874 width=1560 height=454 /></span> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large variety of top-down environments populated with interactable NPCs Characters and participate in various optional and necessary quests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras/08545fbe2160f5fc95ebabc69db721fc.avif?t=1769511874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras_big/08545fbe2160f5fc95ebabc69db721fc.avif?t=1769511874 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off enemy fiends in this top-Down exploration merged with 2D platforming exploration in this large scale adventure game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras/95e8f80484b0802548527c72f4854570.avif?t=1769511874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras_big/95e8f80484b0802548527c72f4854570.avif?t=1769511874 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a large variety of platforming landscapes over hundreds of areas.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between overlapping mirror worlds in real time after collecting the mirror item. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a large variety of optional and necessary puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a multitude of optional hidden secrets, hidden side-quests and hidden collectables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ bosses<br> 50+ different enemy types<br>15+ NPC types<br>450+ collectable items and abilities to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and so much more hidden features and secrets beckoning to challenge gamers and streamers alike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras/d0c588a4c90c58e5238a22d7c78eaa00.avif?t=1769511874\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras_big/d0c588a4c90c58e5238a22d7c78eaa00.avif?t=1769511874 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Raider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea